    <string name="connection_off">Not connected right now. Android reconnects it; until then new messages show up late.</string>
    <string name="battery_body">Some phones put apps to sleep to save battery and Unreplied then hears of messages late. Allowing it to run in the background fixes that. It uses next to no battery.</string>
